      "cooked": "<p>The +1 damage for each power is total for this aspect, not +1 damage to all damage. Example, Quicken the Earth's Struggles does 1 damage to each invader as an option. So I am inclined to believe that it is 1 damage to each invader and then an additional damage so one invader can take two damage. The other option being 2 damage to each invader and at higher levels then 3 damage to each invader. This seems a bit overpowered. Thank you in advance.</p>",
